            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Shenoa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've made this twice, and just as good each time. I used larger lemons so 5 made a little over a full cup. This time I put it over crushed iced and enjoyed like a slushy. Delicious 😋",
            "datePublished": "2025-07-27T20:31:01.504Z"
